---
const portfolioUrl = "https://osaki-ryoma-portfolio.vercel.app/";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>大崎稜馬｜最新ポートフォリオへ移動</title>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0;url=${portfolioUrl}`} />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={portfolioUrl} />
    <script is:inline>
      window.location.replace("https://osaki-ryoma-portfolio.vercel.app/");
    </script>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: #182b43; background: #faf9f4; }
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100svh; display: grid; place-items: center; }
      main { max-width: 34rem; padding: 2rem; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 5vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.5; }
      p { line-height: 1.8; }
      a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .25em; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>最新ポートフォリオへ移動します</h1>
      <p>自動で移動しない場合は、<a href={portfolioUrl}>最新ポートフォリオを開いてください</a>。</p>
      <p><a href="/vol1/">旧ポートフォリオ Vol.1を見る</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
